# Code owners of the Jentrix open client. A pull request needs one approving
# review from an owner of every path it touches (the `main` ruleset enforces
# it). One owner per package, plus a security owner for anything that runs on
# a customer's machine before they read it: hooks, the installer and the
# legacy migration, the provider manifests, the release workflow and its
# scripts. Today every line names the same maintainer account; the second
# Jentrix recovery owner (SECURITY.md, PRD §7 "two recovery owners") is added
# to every line here when appointed.

